---
import Layout from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { Container, Button } from '@components/odyssey-theme';

const seo = {
	title: 'Nosotros — INCOTE',
	description: 'El Instituto Técnico Comercial (INCOTÉ) se fundó en 1984 en San Juan de la Maguana. Conoce nuestra historia.',
};
---

<Layout {seo}>
	<div class="about-hero">
		<Container>
			<div class="about-hero__content">
				<span class="section-label">Nuestra historia</span>
				<h1>Sobre Nosotros</h1>
				<p>Más de 40 años formando profesionales técnicos en República Dominicana.</p>
			</div>
		</Container>
	</div>

	<Container>
		<section class="about-story">
			<div class="about-story__text">
				<h2>Nuestra Historia</h2>
				<p>El <strong>Instituto Técnico Comercial (INCOTÉ)</strong> se fundó en <strong>1984</strong> en San Juan de la Maguana, con el objetivo de brindar formación técnica y moral basada en la ética y la responsabilidad.</p>
				<p>Desde su primera graduación en <strong>1986</strong>, ha crecido significativamente, ofreciendo nuevas carreras técnicas, incluyendo informática en <strong>1992</strong>, e integrando tecnologías educativas desde <strong>1999</strong>.</p>
				<p>Reconocido por <strong>INFOTEP</strong> en <strong>1996</strong> como Centro Colaborador, INCOTÉ ha expandido su presencia a <strong>Santo Domingo (2004)</strong> y <strong>Santiago (2012)</strong>. Ha formado a más de <strong>100,000 profesionales</strong>, recibiendo múltiples premios a la excelencia educativa.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="about-story__stats">
				<div class="about-timeline">
					<div class="timeline-item"><span class="timeline-year">1984</span><span class="timeline-desc">Fundación en San Juan</span></div>
					<div class="timeline-item"><span class="timeline-year">1992</span><span class="timeline-desc">Carreras de informática</span></div>
					<div class="timeline-item"><span class="timeline-year">1996</span><span class="timeline-desc">Reconocimiento INFOTEP</span></div>
					<div class="timeline-item"><span class="timeline-year">2004</span><span class="timeline-desc">Expansión a Santo Domingo</span></div>
					<div class="timeline-item"><span class="timeline-year">2012</span><span class="timeline-desc">Expansión a Santiago</span></div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</Container>

	<!-- Stats -->
	<div class="stats-bg">
		<Container>
			<section class="about-stats">
				<div class="stat-card">
					<span class="stat-number">+500</span>
					<span class="stat-label">Estudiantes activos</span>
				</div>
				<div class="stat-card">
					<span class="stat-number">+20</span>
					<span class="stat-label">Cursos y capacitaciones</span>
				</div>
				<div class="stat-card">
					<span class="stat-number">+50</span>
					<span class="stat-label">Horas de enseñanza</span>
					<span class="stat-sub">mil</span>
				</div>
				<div class="stat-card">
					<span class="stat-number">+40</span>
					<span class="stat-label">Años de servicio</span>
				</div>
			</section>
		</Container>
	</div>

	<!-- Instructors -->
	<Container>
		<section class="instructors-section">
			<div class="section-label">Equipo</div>
			<h2>Conoce a nuestros capacitadores</h2>
			<div class="instructors-grid">
				<div class="instructor-card">
					<div class="instructor-avatar" style="background: var(--theme-gradient-primary);">TL</div>
					<h3>Tadaichi Lopez</h3>
					<span class="instructor-area">Inglés</span>
				</div>
				<div class="instructor-card">
					<div class="instructor-avatar" style="background: var(--theme-gradient-accent); color: var(--theme-on-accent);">JM</div>
					<h3>Jennelly Martínez</h3>
					<span class="instructor-area">Farmacia y Visitador a Médico</span>
				</div>
				<div class="instructor-card">
					<div class="instructor-avatar" style="background: var(--theme-gradient-primary);">SH</div>
					<h3>Sulem Hilario</h3>
					<span class="instructor-area">Secretariado</span>
				</div>
				<div class="instructor-card">
					<div class="instructor-avatar" style="background: var(--theme-gradient-accent); color: var(--theme-on-accent);">CV</div>
					<h3>Carmen Vega</h3>
					<span class="instructor-area">Ventas y Emprendedurismo</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</Container>

	<!-- CTA -->
	<Container>
		<section class="about-cta">
			<h2>¿Listo para formar parte de INCOTE?</h2>
			<p>Contamos con cursos en muchas áreas y en distintos horarios. ¡Inscríbete hoy!</p>
			<Button href="/cursos">Ver Nuestros Cursos</Button>
		</section>
	</Container>
</Layout>

<style>
	.section-label {
		display: inline-block;
		color: var(--theme-accent);
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.about-hero {
		background: var(--theme-gradient-hero);
		padding: 5rem 0;
		color: #fff;
		border-radius: 0 0 var(--theme-shape-radius) var(--theme-shape-radius);
	}
	.about-hero__content {
		max-width: 600px;
	}
	.about-hero__content h1 {
		color: #fff;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}
	.about-hero__content p {
		opacity: 0.8;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}

	.about-story {
		margin: var(--section-margin) auto;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
		gap: 3rem;
		align-items: start;
	}
	.about-story__text h2 {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}
	.about-story__text p {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		opacity: 0.85;
	}

	.about-timeline {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0;
		padding: 0;
	}
	.timeline-item {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1rem;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 1rem 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
	}
	.timeline-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
	.timeline-year {
		font-weight: 800;
		color: var(--theme-primary);
		font-size: 1rem;
		min-width: 60px;
		font-family: var(--theme-font-family-serif);
	}
	.timeline-desc {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		opacity: 0.7;
	}

	/* Stats */
	.stats-bg {
		background: var(--theme-surface-1);
		padding: 3rem 0;
		margin: var(--section-margin) 0;
	}
	.about-stats {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
		gap: 1.5rem;
		text-align: center;
	}
	.stat-card {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 2rem 1rem;
		background: var(--theme-bg);
		border-radius: var(--theme-shape-radius);
		box-shadow: var(--theme-shadow-sm);
	}
	.stat-number {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		color: var(--theme-primary);
		font-family: var(--theme-font-family-serif);
	}
	.stat-label { font-size: 0.85rem; opacity: 0.7; }
	.stat-sub { font-size: 0.7rem; opacity: 0.5; }

	/* Instructors */
	.instructors-section {
		margin: var(--section-margin) auto;
		text-align: center;
	}
	.instructors-section h2 { margin-bottom: 3rem; }
	.instructors-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}
	.instructor-card {
		padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
		background: var(--theme-bg);
		border-radius: var(--theme-shape-radius);
		text-align: center;
		box-shadow: var(--theme-shadow-sm);
		border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
		transition: transform var(--theme-transition), box-shadow var(--theme-transition);
	}
	.instructor-card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-4px);
		box-shadow: var(--theme-shadow-md);
	}
	.instructor-avatar {
		width: 80px; height: 80px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		margin: 0 auto 1.25rem;
		display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
		color: #fff; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700;
		font-family: var(--theme-font-family-serif);
	}
	.instructor-card h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
	.instructor-area { font-size: 0.85rem; opacity: 0.65; }

	/* CTA */
	.about-cta {
		margin: var(--section-margin) auto;
		padding: 4rem 2rem;
		background: var(--theme-gradient-primary);
		border-radius: var(--theme-shape-radius);
		text-align: center;
		color: #fff;
	}
	.about-cta h2 { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #fff; }
	.about-cta p {
		max-width: 500px;
		margin: 0 auto 2rem;
		opacity: 0.8;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.about-story { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.about-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
		.instructors-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
	}
	@media (max-width: 480px) {
		.about-stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.instructors-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
	}
</style>
